      <item>
        <title>Wrap Up for Friday, August 7 and Saturday, August 8, 2026</title>
        <link>https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/08/08/wrap-up-for-friday-august-7-and-saturday-august-8-2026</link>
        <pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 04:58:00 EST</pubDate>
        <dc:creator>
          The Senate Democratic Caucus
        </dc:creator>
        <category>
          Wrap Up
        </category>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.democrats.senate.gov/2026/08/08/wrap-up-for-friday-august-7-and-saturday-august-8-2026</guid>
        <description>
          &lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Wrap Up
for Friday, August 7 and Saturday, August 8, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Roll Call
Votes&lt;u&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style="margin-top:0in"&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Paul
     amendment #6715 to Graham-Blumenthal #6711; not agreed to: 32-64.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;H.R.5334,
     as amended, Sanctions legislation [60 vote threshold]; passed: 86-11.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Confirmation
     of the 74 nominations en bloc as provided for in Executive Calendar #6,
     S.Res.817; confirmed: 51-47.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Motion
     to invoke cloture on Collins substitute #6732 to Cal. #320 H.R.6500,
     vehicle for Continuing Resolution; agreed to: 91-6 with 1 voting present.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Motion
     to table Budd amendment #6747 (Hemp); tabled: 61-32.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Passage
     of H.R.6500, CR, as amended (60 vote threshold); passed: 90-6 with 1
     voting present.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Motion
     to invoke cloture on Executive Calendar #914 Todd Blanche, of Florida, to
     be Attorney General; invoked: 50-49.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Confirmation
     of Executive Calendar #914 Todd Blanche, of Florida, to be Attorney
     General; confirmed: 50-49.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li style="margin-left:0in;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif;"&gt;Motion
     to invoke cloture on the motion to proceed to Cal. #547 S.5271 To amend
     the Help America Vote Act of 2002; not agreed to: 52-46.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;quot;Calibri&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt; [fixture-trimmed]</description>
      </item>
